{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":54,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主爱不移"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“不生育、未生养的妇人啊，要欢唱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"未曾生产的女子啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要欢呼高歌；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为没有丈夫的比有丈夫的儿女更多。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要扩大你支帐篷的地方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尽量铺开帐篷的幔子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"放长绳子，钉牢橛子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你要向左右扩展，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的后裔要占据列国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使荒凉的城邑重新有人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"“不要害怕，因为你不会再受羞辱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要恐惧，因为你不会再受凌辱。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必忘记年轻时的羞辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再想起寡居时的耻辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为造你的是你的丈夫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂名叫万军之耶和华；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的救赎主是以色列的圣者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂被称为普天下的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华要召你回来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同召一个遭遗弃、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中忧伤的少妻。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是你的上帝说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我丢弃了你片刻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我要怀着极大的怜悯接你回来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我盛怒之下暂时掩面不理你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我要以永远不变的慈爱怜悯你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是你的救赎主耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"“这对我而言就像挪亚的时代，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我怎样起誓不再让挪亚时代的洪水淹没大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也照样起誓不再向你发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再斥责你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大山可以挪开，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"小山可以迁移，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的慈爱必不离开你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我平安的约也不会更改。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是怜悯你的耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"“困苦不堪、饱经风雨、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得不着安慰的城啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要以彩石作你的地基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用蓝宝石建造你的根基，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用红宝石建你的城楼、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水晶造你的城门、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宝石建你的城墙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的儿女都必受耶和华的训诲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安享太平。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必因公义而坚立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再不会受欺压，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不会担惊受怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为恐惧不会临近你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倘若有人来攻打你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那必不是我的旨意。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻打你的必然失败。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，是我造了扇旺炭火、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"铸造合用兵器的铁匠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我造了毁灭者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为攻击你而造的兵器必不能奏效，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必驳倒所有控告你的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华众仆人的产业，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我给他们的胜利","poem":1},{"noteId":24},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":24,"caller":"+","text":"“胜利”或译“公义”。","reference":{"chapter":54,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/54.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/55.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/53.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}